# Backend

## Structure

- Routes: `backend/app/api/` (`articles`, `clusters`, `bias`, `rumors`, **`ingest`**, **`admin`**) mounted in `app/api/__init__.py`
- Models: `app/models/` (`article`, `cluster`, `source`); Pydantic: `app/schemas/` (`ingest.py` → `IngestResponse`; **`admin.py`** → `AdminOverviewResponse`)
- Business logic: `app/services/` — `rss_parser` (fetch/parse feeds), **`rss_ingestion`** (persist + cluster), `ai_client`, **`admin_stats`** (ops overview aggregates), **`ops_alerts`** (Healthchecks + Telegram) — keep route handlers thin
- Monitoring: `app/core/sentry_init.py` — call `init_sentry()` from `main.py` (not inside lifespan)
- Seed data: `app/data/bd_sources_seed.py`
- Config: `app/core/config.py` (`Settings`, prefix `/api/v1`, `ingest_api_key`, **`admin_api_key`**, `rss_fetch_timeout_seconds`, optional `sentry_*`, `healthchecks_ingest_url`, `telegram_*`)
- DB: `app/core/database.py` (`SessionLocal`, `get_db`); tables created on startup in `app/main.py` lifespan
- CLI ingest: `backend/scripts/ingest_rss.py` (`notify_ingest_started` → run → `notify_ingest_finished` or `notify_ingest_failed`); root `npm run ingest:backend`
- Health: `GET /health` (outside API prefix)

## API surface

- `GET /api/v1/articles`, `/clusters`, `/clusters/{slug}`, `/bias`, `/rumors`
- **`GET /api/v1/admin/overview`** — `get_admin_overview`; if `ADMIN_API_KEY` is set, require header `X-Admin-Key`
- **`POST /api/v1/ingest`** — runs `run_rss_ingest`; if `INGEST_API_KEY` is set, require header `X-Ingest-Key`; on success/failure calls `notify_ingest_finished` / `notify_ingest_failed` from `ops_alerts`
- OpenAPI: `/docs` when server is running

## RSS ingestion

- Entry point: `run_rss_ingest(session)` in `app/services/rss_ingestion.py`
- Seeds/updates `Source` rows from `BD_SOURCE_SEED`, fetches each feed via `fetch_feed_items`, skips duplicate URLs, assigns articles to existing clusters by title similarity or creates new `Cluster` with unique slug
- May call `ai_client.summarize_cluster` when a cluster gains multiple articles
- Returns `IngestResult` counts + per-source error strings (ingest continues on fetch failures)

## Patterns

- Use **async** endpoints and DB/HTTP for I/O-bound work
- Add new resources as a router module + schema + model; register on `api_router`
- AI calls go through `AIClient`; respect `settings.ai_provider` and optional API keys
- Scheduled ingest: cron/worker should call CLI or `POST /api/v1/ingest` so Healthchecks/Telegram hooks run; reuse `run_rss_ingest` for logic only if you duplicate ops calls intentionally
- `ops_alerts.notify_payment_webhook` — stub for future bKash webhook handlers
- Planned: deeper clustering jobs

